	(text "Do not use ceramic caps from X or Y series for signals.\nCapacitors should be rated for >=63 VDC\nBuy 2x of everything\nDC voltage at TP U1A+ should be half of VCC (or atleast between 3.5 V-4.7 V) ! Change R2 value.\n\nChange R1 value to a larger one up to 330 Ohm if not clipping when R2 is balanced."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
